      "id": "claim_302f5ebf43a74fb2a31f7614893cd310",
      "statement": "Structured output is a system mechanism that ensures a language model returns responses matching a specific JSON schema, with the agent supporting three strategies (tool-based, provider-native, and automatic) to enforce schema compliance, parse responses, validate against the schema using Pydantic's TypeAdapter, and automatically retry on validation errors.",
